  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ミルスベリヒユ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B9%E3%83%99%E3%83%AA%E3%83%92%E3%83%A6",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 106282152,
      "text": "ミルスベリヒユ はハマミズナ科ミルスベリヒユ属の多年生草本。別名ハマミズナ，ハマスベリヒユ。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Sesuvium portulacastrum",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sesuvium_portulacastrum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1315343079,
      "text": "Sesuvium portulacastrum is a sprawling perennial herb in the family Aizoaceae that grows in coastal and mangrove areas throughout much of the world. It grows in sandy clay, coastal limestone and sandstone, tidal flats and salt marshes, throughout much of the world. It is native to Africa, Asia, Australia, Hawai`i, North America and South America, and has naturalised in many places where it is not indigenous."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Sesuvium portulacastrum",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sesuvium_portulacastrum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 173438201,
      "text": "Sesuvium portulacastrum, o verdolaga de playa, es una especie de planta suculenta perteneciente a la familia de las aizoáceas. Es una hierba perennifolia que se expande en las zonas costeras a lo largo de gran parte del mundo."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Sesuvium portulacastrum",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sesuvium_portulacastrum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 211633421,
      "text": "Sesuvium portulacastrum, ou Sésuvie à fleurs de pourpier, parfois appelé pourpier de mer, est une plante succulente herbacée pérenne de la famille des Aizoaceae, cosmopolite, qui croît dans les zones côtières."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Sesuvium portulacastrum",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sesuvium_portulacastrum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 71482698,
      "text": "Sesuvium portulacastrum é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Aizoaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Krokot laut daun lancip",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krokot_laut_daun_lancip",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29220786,
      "text": "Sesuvium portulacastrum (Tagalog:Dampalit) atau dikenal secara lokal sebagai krokot laut daun lancip adalah spesies tumbuhan yang dapat ditemui di wilayah pesisir di berbagai belahan dunia. Spesies ini dapat ditemui di Afrika, Asia, Australia, Amerika Utara, dan Amerika Selatan. Habitatnya adalah tanah liat berpasir, batu kapur dan batu pasir di pantai, dan rawa-rawa asin."
    }
  },
